<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 6/7.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 6/7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>6/7. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 6/7	    May 5/6</p>
<p> CZK	0.44826	    0.44685</p>
<p> DKK	2.09978	    2.10076</p>
<p> FIM	2.65415	    2.65185</p>
<p> HUF	0.07576	    0.0758</p>
<p> JPY	0.10994	    0.10916</p>
<p> LTL	3.45577	    3.45418</p>
<p> LVL     23.72544	   23.73956</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	     0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.75289	    1.75027</p>
<p> UAH	7.63024	    7.58858</p>
<p> USD     13.826	     13.8188</p>
<p> XEU     15.5978	    15.60488</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
